# MOBILE-RESPONSIVE DESIGN - MOBILE-FIRST EXCELLENCE

## MANDATORY
Every page MUST be perfect on mobile AND desktop. Mobile-first approach is non-negotiable.

## 1. VIEWPORT & META TAGS (CRITICAL)
```html
<!-- MANDATORY on every page -->
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#000000">
<meta name="mobile-web-app-capable" content="yes">
```

## 2. RESPONSIVE BREAKPOINTS
```css
/* Mobile First - Base styles for 320px+ */
.container { width: 100%; padding: 1rem; }

/* Small devices (576px+) */
@media (min-width: 576px) { .container { max-width: 540px; margin: 0 auto; } }

/* Medium devices / Tablets (768px+) */
@media (min-width: 768px) { .container { max-width: 720px; } }

/* Large devices / Desktops (992px+) */
@media (min-width: 992px) { .container { max-width: 960px; } }

/* Extra large (1200px+) */
@media (min-width: 1200px) { .container { max-width: 1140px; } }

/* Ultra-wide (1536px+) */
@media (min-width: 1536px) { .container { max-width: 1440px; } }
```

## 3. TOUCH-FRIENDLY DESIGN (CRITICAL)
```css
/* Minimum touch target size: 44px (Apple HIG / WCAG) */
button, .btn, input[type="submit"], a.nav-link {
    min-height: 44px;
    min-width: 44px;
    padding: 12px 16px;
}
```

## 4. FLEXIBLE LAYOUTS
```css
/* Flexbox for responsive rows */
.flex-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
}
.flex-item {
    flex: 1 1 300px; /* grow, shrink, minimum width */
}

/* Grid for responsive grids */
.grid-container {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
}
```

## 5. RESPONSIVE IMAGES (CRITICAL)
```html
<img src="image-800.webp"
     srcset="image-400.webp 400w,
             image-800.webp 800w,
             image-1200.webp 1200w"
     sizes="(max-width: 768px) 100vw,
            (max-width: 1200px) 50vw,
            33vw"
     alt="Descriptive text"
     loading="lazy">
```
```css
img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
```

## 6. MOBILE NAVIGATION
```css
/* Hamburger menu for mobile */
.mobile-menu-toggle { display: none; }

@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mobile-menu-toggle { display: block; }
    .nav-menu {
        display: none;
        position: fixed;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100vh;
        background: var(--bg-surface);
        z-index: 1000;
    }
    .nav-menu.active { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
    .nav-link { display: block; padding: 1rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-color); }
}
```

