## 8. TOUCH GESTURE SUPPORT
- Swipe navigation for carousels and galleries
- Pull-to-refresh where applicable
- Long-press for context menus
- Prevent gesture conflicts with native scrolling
- Safe area insets for modern phones with notches:
```css
padding-top: env(safe-area-inset-top);
padding-bottom: env(safe-area-inset-bottom);
padding-left: env(safe-area-inset-left);
padding-right: env(safe-area-inset-right);
```

## 9. RESPONSIVE TYPOGRAPHY
```css
/* Fluid typography using clamp() */
h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 2rem); }
body { font-size: clamp(0.875rem, 1.5vw, 1rem); }
```

## TESTING CHECKLIST
- [ ] Test on real mobile devices (not just browser DevTools)
- [ ] Test on iOS Safari and Android Chrome
- [ ] Verify all touch targets are at least 44x44px
- [ ] Test at 320px width (smallest common screen)
- [ ] Test landscape orientation
- [ ] Verify no horizontal overflow at any breakpoint
- [ ] Test with slow network (3G throttle)
- [ ] Verify images load lazily and are appropriately sized
